      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person collects, uses or discloses data; and\n\n(b) the data is COVID app data; and\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 44, 2020\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\n\n(c) the collection, use or disclosure is not permitted under this\nsection.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 5 years or 300 penalty units, or both."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-1-norm",
