    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94D(5) Collection, use or disclosure of COVID app data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94d-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(5) COVID app data is data relating to a person that:\n\n(a) has been collected or generated (including before the\ncommencement of this Part) through the operation of\nCOVIDSafe; and\n\n(b) either:\n\n(i) is registration data; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 44, 2020\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\n\n(ii) is stored, or has been stored (including before the\ncommencement of this Part), on a communication\ndevice.\nHowever, it does not include:\n\n(c) information obtained, from a source other than directly from\nthe National COVIDSafe Data Store, in the course of\nundertaking contact tracing by a person employed by, or in\nthe service of, a State or Territory health authority; or\n\n(d) de-identified statistical information about the total number of\nregistrations through COVIDSafe that is produced by:\n\n(i) an officer or employee of the data store administrator;\nor\n\n(ii) a contracted service provider for a government contract\nwith the data store administrator.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) COVID app data is data relating to a person that:\n\n(a) has been collected or generated (including before the\ncommencement of this Part) through the operation of\nCOVIDSafe; and\n\n(b) either:\n\n(i) is registration data; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 44, 2020\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\n\n(ii) is stored, or has been stored (including before the\ncommencement of this Part), on a communication\ndevice.\nHowever, it does not include:\n\n(c) information obtained, from a source other than directly from\nthe National COVIDSafe Data Store, in the course of\nundertaking contact tracing by a person employed by, or in\nthe service of, a State or Territory health authority; or\n\n(d) de-identified statistical information about the total number of\nregistrations through COVIDSafe that is produced by:\n\n(i) an officer or employee of the data store administrator;\nor\n\n(ii) a contracted service provider for a government contract\nwith the data store administrator.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f9e666fd88207ad6fc10a24fd19fffe02757add1f9268c521808120034978067",
      "skos:note": "Prohibition on disclosure of COVID app data obtained from sources other than the National COVIDSafe Data Store"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94D(5) Collection, use or disclosure of COVID app data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(5) COVID app data is data relating to a person that:\n\n(a) has been collected or generated (including before the\ncommencement of this Part) through the operation of\nCOVIDSafe; and\n\n(b) either:\n\n(i) is registration data; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 44, 2020\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\n\n(ii) is stored, or has been stored (including before the\ncommencement of this Part), on a communication\ndevice.\nHowever, it does not include:\n\n(c) information obtained, from a source other than directly from\nthe National COVIDSafe Data Store, in the course of\nundertaking contact tracing by a person employed by, or in\nthe service of, a State or Territory health authority; or\n\n(d) de-identified statistical information about the total number of\nregistrations through COVIDSafe that is produced by:\n\n(i) an officer or employee of the data store administrator;\nor\n\n(ii) a contracted service provider for a government contract\nwith the data store administrator."
    },
