    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94D(6) Collection, use or disclosure of COVID app data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94d-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Contact tracing is the process of identifying persons who have\nbeen in contact with a person who has tested positive for the\ncoronavirus known as COVID-19, and includes:\n\n(a) notifying a person that the person has been in contact with a\nperson who has tested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; and\n\n(b) notifying a person who is a parent, guardian or carer of\nanother person that the other person has been in contact with\na person who has tested positive for the coronavirus known\nas COVID-19; and\n\n(c) providing information and advice to a person who:\n\n(i) has tested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; or\n\n(ii) is a parent, guardian or carer of another person who has\ntested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; or\n\n(iii) has been in contact with a person who has tested\npositive for the coronavirus known as COVID-19; or\n\n(iv) is a parent, guardian or carer of another person who has\nbeen in contact with a person who has tested positive for\nthe coronavirus known as COVID-19.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\nNo. 44, 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Contact tracing is the process of identifying persons who have\nbeen in contact with a person who has tested positive for the\ncoronavirus known as COVID-19, and includes:\n\n(a) notifying a person that the person has been in contact with a\nperson who has tested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; and\n\n(b) notifying a person who is a parent, guardian or carer of\nanother person that the other person has been in contact with\na person who has tested positive for the coronavirus known\nas COVID-19; and\n\n(c) providing information and advice to a person who:\n\n(i) has tested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; or\n\n(ii) is a parent, guardian or carer of another person who has\ntested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; or\n\n(iii) has been in contact with a person who has tested\npositive for the coronavirus known as COVID-19; or\n\n(iv) is a parent, guardian or carer of another person who has\nbeen in contact with a person who has tested positive for\nthe coronavirus known as COVID-19.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\nNo. 44, 2020",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94d-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a128578a92acad3dfdfe3a4750d41494aeabdca1a4793c5c8323333a06024523",
      "skos:note": "Contact tracing is required for persons who have tested positive for COVID-19 or are in contact with them.",
      "dc:description": "Notification of contact and provision of information and advice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94D(6) Collection, use or disclosure of COVID app data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Contact tracing is the process of identifying persons who have\nbeen in contact with a person who has tested positive for the\ncoronavirus known as COVID-19, and includes:\n\n(a) notifying a person that the person has been in contact with a\nperson who has tested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; and\n\n(b) notifying a person who is a parent, guardian or carer of\nanother person that the other person has been in contact with\na person who has tested positive for the coronavirus known\nas COVID-19; and\n\n(c) providing information and advice to a person who:\n\n(i) has tested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; or\n\n(ii) is a parent, guardian or carer of another person who has\ntested positive for the coronavirus known as\nCOVID-19; or\n\n(iii) has been in contact with a person who has tested\npositive for the coronavirus known as COVID-19; or\n\n(iv) is a parent, guardian or carer of another person who has\nbeen in contact with a person who has tested positive for\nthe coronavirus known as COVID-19.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020\nNo. 44, 2020"
    },
