      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subsection (2) is a workplace law for the purposes of the Fair\nWork Act 2009; and\n\n(b) the benefit that the other person derives because of an\nobligation of the person under subsection (2) is a workplace\nright within the meaning of Part 3-1 of that Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) To avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subsection (2) is a workplace law for the purposes of the Fair\nWork Act 2009; and\n\n(b) the benefit that the other person derives because of an\nobligation of the person under subsection (2) is a workplace\nright within the meaning of Part 3-1 of that Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94h"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94h-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94h-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4aa46818e965af15384241d981cdda8281f20faf405384f278b24bf5eb71fe37",
      "skos:note": "Requiring the use of COVIDSafe"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94h-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94H(3) Requiring the use of COVIDSafe",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subsection (2) is a workplace law for the purposes of the Fair\nWork Act 2009; and\n\n(b) the benefit that the other person derives because of an\nobligation of the person under subsection (2) is a workplace\nright within the meaning of Part 3-1 of that Act."
    },
