        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94l-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f2acd024fa433246860a5343b01ee2c01a677220892789a472729e8097f3541f",
      "skos:note": "Data administrator must confirm data deletion upon request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94l-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94L(3) Deletion of registration data on request",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (1) does not:\n\n(a) prevent the data store administrator from accessing data for\nthe purpose of, and only to the extent required for the\npurpose of, confirming that the correct data is being deleted;\nor\n\n(b) require the data store administrator to delete from the\nNational COVIDSafe Data Store data relating to the person\nthat:\n\n(i) was uploaded from another communication device in\nrelation to which another person is a COVIDSafe user;\nand\n\n(ii) was collected through the other device interacting with\nthe device mentioned in subsection (1)."
    },
