    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94r",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94R Breach of requirement is an interference with privacy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94r"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An act or practice in breach of a requirement of this Part in relation\nto an individual constitutes an act or practice involving an\ninterference with the privacy of the individual for the purposes of\nsection 13.\nNote:\nThe act or practice may be the subject of a complaint under section 36.\n\n(2) Subsections 7(1A) and (1B) do not limit what is taken to be an act\nor practice for the purposes of subsection (1) of this section, or for\nthe purposes of the application of this Act in relation to an\ninterference with the privacy of an individual involving a breach of\na requirement of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An act or practice in breach of a requirement of this Part in relation\nto an individual constitutes an act or practice involving an\ninterference with the privacy of the individual for the purposes of\nsection 13.\nNote:\nThe act or practice may be the subject of a complaint under section 36.\n\n(2) Subsections 7(1A) and (1B) do not limit what is taken to be an act\nor practice for the purposes of subsection (1) of this section, or for\nthe purposes of the application of this Act in relation to an\ninterference with the privacy of an individual involving a breach of\na requirement of this Part.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94r-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94r-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed4ee3d19da594bd174b41b0f95a0ebec1dd4d0a5751e7695dc2127c1db80fe9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94r",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94R Breach of requirement is an interference with privacy",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An act or practice in breach of a requirement of this Part in relation\nto an individual constitutes an act or practice involving an\ninterference with the privacy of the individual for the purposes of\nsection 13.\nNote:\nThe act or practice may be the subject of a complaint under section 36.\n\n(2) Subsections 7(1A) and (1B) do not limit what is taken to be an act\nor practice for the purposes of subsection (1) of this section, or for\nthe purposes of the application of this Act in relation to an\ninterference with the privacy of an individual involving a breach of\na requirement of this Part."
    },
