    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94S(3) Breach of requirement may be treated as an eligible data breach",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Part IIIC applies in relation to such a breach as if:\n\n(a) subsection 26WE(3) and sections 26WF, 26WH and 26WJ\ndid not apply in relation to the breach; and\n\n(b) Subdivision B of Division 3 of that Part:\n\n(i) required the data store administrator, or State or\nTerritory health authority, to notify the Commissioner\nthat there were reasonable grounds to believe that there\nhad been an eligible data breach; and\n\n(ii) only required compliance with sections 26WK and\n26WL in relation to the breach if the Commissioner\nrequired the administrator or authority so to comply;\nand\n\n(c) sections 26WN, 26WP, 26WQ, 26WS and 26WT did not\napply in relation to the breach.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Part IIIC applies in relation to such a breach as if:\n\n(a) subsection 26WE(3) and sections 26WF, 26WH and 26WJ\ndid not apply in relation to the breach; and\n\n(b) Subdivision B of Division 3 of that Part:\n\n(i) required the data store administrator, or State or\nTerritory health authority, to notify the Commissioner\nthat there were reasonable grounds to believe that there\nhad been an eligible data breach; and\n\n(ii) only required compliance with sections 26WK and\n26WL in relation to the breach if the Commissioner\nrequired the administrator or authority so to comply;\nand\n\n(c) sections 26WN, 26WP, 26WQ, 26WS and 26WT did not\napply in relation to the breach.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6ee55c9d1b121e1475a109941ae250962b3bff6d2614399752fa170f9fe3691d",
      "skos:note": "Notify the Commissioner of reasonable grounds to believe an eligible data breach has occurred."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94S(3) Breach of requirement may be treated as an eligible data breach",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Part IIIC applies in relation to such a breach as if:\n\n(a) subsection 26WE(3) and sections 26WF, 26WH and 26WJ\ndid not apply in relation to the breach; and\n\n(b) Subdivision B of Division 3 of that Part:\n\n(i) required the data store administrator, or State or\nTerritory health authority, to notify the Commissioner\nthat there were reasonable grounds to believe that there\nhad been an eligible data breach; and\n\n(ii) only required compliance with sections 26WK and\n26WL in relation to the breach if the Commissioner\nrequired the administrator or authority so to comply;\nand\n\n(c) sections 26WN, 26WP, 26WQ, 26WS and 26WT did not\napply in relation to the breach."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Duty to notify",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Subdivision B of Division 3 of Part IIIC requires notification.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The data store administrator or State/Territory health authority must notify the Commissioner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": ">=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval for notification",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Subdivision B of Division 3 of Part IIIC requires notification within a certain timeframe.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The notification must occur within the specified temporal interval."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IMPLIES",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consequence of subdivision B",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Subdivision B of Division 3 of Part IIIC requires notification.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The data store administrator or State/Territory health authority must notify the Commissioner if there are reasonable grounds to believe an eligible data breach has occurred."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IF-THEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional notification",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Only compliance with sections 26WK and 26WL is required if the Commissioner requires so.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The data store administrator or State/Territory health authority must notify the Commissioner only if required to do so by the Commissioner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IS-A",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Data breach notification system",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Part IIIC applies in relation to such a breach as if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The data store administrator or State/Territory health authority must use the Part IIIC system for notification."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94S(4) Breach of requirement may be treated as an eligible data breach",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the circumstances in which the Commissioner\nmay, under subparagraph (3)(b)(ii), require the administrator or\nauthority so to comply, the Commissioner must so require if:\n\n(a) the Commissioner is satisfied that the breach may be likely to\nresult in serious harm to any of the individuals to whom the\ninformation relates; and\n\n(b) subsection (5) does not apply.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting the circumstances in which the Commissioner\nmay, under subparagraph (3)(b)(ii), require the administrator or\nauthority so to comply, the Commissioner must so require if:\n\n(a) the Commissioner is satisfied that the breach may be likely to\nresult in serious harm to any of the individuals to whom the\ninformation relates; and\n\n(b) subsection (5) does not apply.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3ba57f0f21353211354df7ed691f3fa990ee83a1e9b5cc3b83e8a7f5462a7ccf",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner must require administrator or authority to comply with breach if it may result in serious harm."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94s-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94S(4) Breach of requirement may be treated as an eligible data breach",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the circumstances in which the Commissioner\nmay, under subparagraph (3)(b)(ii), require the administrator or\nauthority so to comply, the Commissioner must so require if:\n\n(a) the Commissioner is satisfied that the breach may be likely to\nresult in serious harm to any of the individuals to whom the\ninformation relates; and\n\n(b) subsection (5) does not apply."
    },
