      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Upon receiving notice under subsection (3) or (4) the\nCommissioner may continue the investigation discontinued under\nparagraph (2)(c).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Upon receiving notice under subsection (3) or (4) the\nCommissioner may continue the investigation discontinued under\nparagraph (2)(c).",
      "values:partOf": {
