    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94x",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94X Application to State or Territory health authorities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94x"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Act applies in relation to a State or Territory health authority,\nas if the authority were an organisation, to the extent that the\nauthority deals with, or the activities of the authority relate to,\nCOVID app data.\n\n(2) However, subsection (1) does not, in relation to a State or Territory\nhealth authority:\n\n(a) have the effect of applying Australian Privacy Principle 9 in\nrelation to a government related identifier that has been\nassigned by that State or Territory or by a State or Territory\nauthority of that State or Territory; or\n\n(b) have the effect of applying this Act in relation to data or\ninformation that is not COVID app data.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Act applies in relation to a State or Territory health authority,\nas if the authority were an organisation, to the extent that the\nauthority deals with, or the activities of the authority relate to,\nCOVID app data.\n\n(2) However, subsection (1) does not, in relation to a State or Territory\nhealth authority:\n\n(a) have the effect of applying Australian Privacy Principle 9 in\nrelation to a government related identifier that has been\nassigned by that State or Territory or by a State or Territory\nauthority of that State or Territory; or\n\n(b) have the effect of applying this Act in relation to data or\ninformation that is not COVID app data.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94x-ss-1"
        },
        {
