      "skos:note": "Report must be prepared within 3 months after a specified day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020#sch-1-sec-94zb-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94ZB(2) Reports by the Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the day determined under subsection 94Y(1) occurs during the 6\nmonth period starting on the commencement of this Part, the report\nunder subsection (1) of this section relating to that period must be\nprepared within 3 months after that day."
    },
